  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.67,
      "end": 2.62,
      "text": "This mammoth may have had"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.62,
      "end": 4.08,
      "text": "an extraordinary coat."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.54,
      "end": 6.53,
      "text": "Scientists found two mutations"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.53,
      "end": 7.87,
      "text": "in a gene linked"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.87,
      "end": 9.04,
      "text": "to hair development."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.49,
      "end": 11.23,
      "text": "They predicted a silky coat,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.67,
      "end": 13.43,
      "text": "but could not observe it directly."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.71,
      "end": 15.47,
      "text": "The animal lived on Wrangel Island,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.84,
      "end": 16.92,
      "text": "in the Arctic Ocean,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.29,
      "end": 18.63,
      "text": "a few thousand years ago."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.04,
      "end": 20.06,
      "text": "Now the strange part."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.48,
      "end": 22.35,
      "text": "A later study of ancient genomes"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.61,
      "end": 24.15,
      "text": "found that the island population"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.15,
      "end": 26.7,
      "text": "recovered after an extreme bottleneck."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.04,
      "end": 29.0,
      "text": "Yet the mammoths eventually disappeared."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.26,
      "end": 30.83,
      "text": "How can both things be true?"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.22,
      "end": 33.39,
      "text": "Scientists have examined genetic damage,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.67,
      "end": 35.57,
      "text": "climate, and human arrival,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.96,
      "end": 37.48,
      "text": "but the final generations"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.48,
      "end": 39.31,
      "text": "are missing from the genetic record."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.69,
      "end": 41.88,
      "text": "So which explanation holds up?"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.11,
      "end": 43.58,
      "text": "We will take the evidence apart,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.98,
      "end": 44.78,
      "text": "and at the end,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.07,
      "end": 46.47,
      "text": "separate what is proven,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.9,
      "end": 47.84,
      "text": "what is plausible,"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.19,
      "end": 49.29,
      "text": "and what is still missing"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.29,
      "end": 49.97,
      "text": "from the file."
    }
  ],
  "reconstruction_note": "All mammoth, island and case-board imagery is original 3D reconstruction built for this film; it is an illustration, not a photograph, a scan or laboratory footage."
